  Scenario: Receipt of a successful charge event from stripe connect
    Given there is a connect webhook signature for the mock payload "stripe/connect/charges/succeeded-success.json"
    And I make a POST request to the API endpoint "/admin/webhooks/connect" as "connect" with the mock "stripe/connect/charges/succeeded-success.json"
    Then there should be a 200 response from the "connect" request that contains:
      | result    |
      | OBJECT_ID |
    When I am logged in with the "webhooks-connect-charges-one@venzra-test.io" admin account
    And I make a GET request to the API endpoint "/admin/orders/{{ orders[1]._id }}" as "order"
    Then there should be a 200 response from the "order" request that contains:
      | _id       | customer | reference    | items    | shipping                              | destination | billing | payment | history  | status     | created   | updated   |
      | OBJECT_ID | OBJECT   | "1111111111" | ARRAY[1] | { "name": "Example A", "price": 100 } | OBJECT      | OBJECT  | OBJECT  | ARRAY[1] | AUTHORISED | DATE_TIME | DATE_TIME |
    And the "order" request that has a "history" field and row 1 contains:
      | field  | previous | next       | created   |
      | status | CREATED  | AUTHORISED | DATE_TIME |

  Scenario: Duplicate successful charge event from stripe connect is ignored with a positive response
    Given there is a connect webhook signature for the mock payload "stripe/connect/charges/succeeded-success.json"
    And I make a POST request to the API endpoint "/admin/webhooks/connect" as "connect" with the mock "stripe/connect/charges/succeeded-success.json"
    Then there should be a 200 response from the "connect" request that contains:
      | result    |
      | OBJECT_ID |

  Scenario: If there is no matching order for the charge reference return an error
    Given there is a connect webhook signature for the mock payload "stripe/connect/charges/succeeded-invalid.json"
    And I make a POST request to the API endpoint "/admin/webhooks/connect" as "connect" with the mock "stripe/connect/charges/succeeded-invalid.json"
    Then the status returned from the "connect" request should be a 404 error
